3542f20c-5d3f-44e1-801f-c504a5a08dfc	5fe15466-4e2e-4ff2-981e-98c1b7074002	identity	{"tone": "Direct, no-nonsense, industry-insider. Write as an experienced fuel supply professional, not a salesperson. Use plain language, avoid corporate filler, and speak to operational realities. Phrases like 'without the runaround' and 'no last-minute surprises' reflect the benchmark. Confidence comes from expertise, not enthusiasm.", "email": "gas@contactforsales.com", "phone": "+44 (0) 7934 524 911", "contact": {"email": null, "phone": null, "address": null, "location": null}, "tagline": null, "industry": "Energy & Fuel Distribution", "services": [{"name": "Wholesale Fuel Distribution", "description": "Bulk supply of gasoline and diesel to retailers and commercial clients"}, {"name": "Fleet Fuel Services", "description": "Fuel supply solutions for commercial fleet operations"}, {"name": "Natural Gas Distribution", "description": "Wholesale natural gas supply to industrial and commercial customers"}, {"name": "Rack Pricing Programs", "description": "Wholesale rack fuel pricing for resellers and distributors"}], "key_people": [], "company_name": "Gas Wholesalers", "sub_industry": "Wholesale Gas & Petroleum Products", "about_summary": "Gas Wholesalers appears to be a wholesale distribution company focused on gas and petroleum products. Based on the domain name and industry research, this likely involves the wholesale supply of gasoline, diesel, natural gas, or related energy products to retailers, fleet operators, or industrial clients. The company would operate in the B2B fuel distribution market.", "content_brief": "Industry: Fuel wholesale and distribution (gasoline, diesel, natural gas). Target audience: Gas station and fuel forecourt operators, commercial and municipal fleet managers, convenience store chains, industrial bulk fuel buyers, and independent fuel retailers. Primary decision-makers are procurement managers, operations directors, and owner-operators. Tone: Direct, no-nonsense, trade-facing — written as experienced industry insiders, not salespeople. Avoid marketing fluff and consumer-facing language. Purpose: Generate qualified wholesale fuel enquiries by demonstrating supply reliability, pricing transparency, and a friction-free supplier relationship.", "site_metadata": "Industry: Fuel Wholesale & Distribution. Target Audience: Gas station owners, fuel retailers, commercial fleet operators, industrial facilities, convenience store chains, and bulk fuel buyers. Tone: Direct, professional, and industry-knowledgeable — written as experienced insiders, not salespeople. Emphasise reliability, transparency, and no-nonsense service. Purpose: Generate wholesale fuel supply enquiries from qualified commercial and industrial buyers.", "site_strategy": "Industry: Petroleum wholesale and fuel distribution. Target audience: Gas station owners, fuel retailers, commercial fleet operators, industrial facilities, convenience store chains, and businesses requiring bulk fuel purchases. Tone: Direct, professional, no-nonsense — written from the perspective of experienced industry insiders, not salespeople. Emphasis on reliability, pricing transparency, and straightforward service. Purpose: Generate qualified B2B leads from fuel buyers who need a dependable wholesale distribution partner.", "social_profiles": {}, "target_audience": "Gas station owners and fuel forecourt operators, commercial and municipal fleet managers, convenience store chains requiring branded or unbranded fuel supply, industrial facilities with bulk fuel procurement needs, and independent fuel retailers seeking wholesale pricing programs. Primary decision-makers are procurement managers, operations directors, and owner-operators who prioritize supply reliability, pricing transparency, and a no-friction supplier relationship over low-touch commodity brokering.", "competitors_found": ["econogas.ca", "igasusa.com"], "has_existing_site": false, "existing_site_quality": "none", "unique_selling_points": ["Wholesale pricing for bulk fuel purchases", "Direct terminal access and distribution networks", "B2B focused fuel supply solutions", "Competitive rack pricing programs"], "target_market_and_locale": "Confirm whether Gas Wholesalers operates in the UK, US, or another market. If UK-based: replace 'gasoline' with 'petrol' or 'fuel' throughout, use UK business conventions (VAT, pence per litre pricing references), and ensure phone numbers and address formats are UK-standard. If US-based: replace the +44 phone number with a US number and audit all contact details. Once confirmed, update the service-areas page to explicitly name the regions, counties, or states served so prospects can immediately determine if they are in the coverage zone.", "target_audience_and_purpose": "Primary industry vertical: wholesale fuel distribution. Target audience segments: (1) forecourt operators and gas station owners purchasing bulk fuel for resale, (2) commercial fleet managers seeking reliable fuel supply contracts and rack pricing, (3) industrial facilities and large commercial buyers requiring consistent volume delivery. Site purpose: lead generation — drive qualified inbound inquiries from buyers who need a dependable wholesale fuel partner. All content decisions should be evaluated against these guardrails: does it speak to one of these three segments, does it reinforce reliability and transparency, and does it move a prospect toward a contact or inquiry action.", "industry_audience_tone_purpose": "Industry: Wholesale Fuel Distribution (Energy & Fuel sector, B2B). Target Audience: Gas station owners, fuel retailers, commercial fleet operators, industrial facilities, convenience store chains, and bulk fuel buyers. Tone: Direct, no-nonsense, experienced industry insider — not promotional or salesy; communicates reliability and transparency. Purpose: Generate qualified B2B enquiries from businesses requiring wholesale fuel supply, rack pricing programs, fleet fuel services, or natural gas distribution.", "tagline_and_product_terminology": "Replace the current tagline 'Wholesale Gas Supply Solutions' with one that reflects the full product scope, such as 'Wholesale Fuel, Natural Gas & Specialty Gas Distribution' or 'Complete Wholesale Fuel & Gas Supply.' Define three canonical product categories for use across all pages: (1) Wholesale Fuel Distribution — gasoline, diesel, and refined petroleum products; (2) Natural Gas Distribution — commercial and industrial natural gas supply; (3) Specialty Gases — any non-commodity gas products referenced on the services page. Enforce this terminology framework site-wide so homepage subheadlines, service descriptions, page titles, and meta descriptions all use the same category names without variation.", "industry, target_audience, tone, purpose": "Industry: Wholesale Fuel Distribution (Energy & Fuel sector). Target Audience: Gas station owners, fuel retailers, commercial fleet operators, industrial facilities, convenience store chains, and bulk fuel buyers. Tone: Direct, no-nonsense, expert B2B — written as experienced industry insiders, not salespeople. Purpose: Lead generation and wholesale fuel supply enquiries — converting qualified commercial buyers into contacts and long-term supply relationships."}	content-gap-planner	content-gap-planner	\N	\N	t	2026-03-17 23:01:05.751284+00	\N	content-gap-planner	f
