nd leads for custom multi-agent system design and production deployment engagements.", "industry,target_audience,tone,messaging_pillars": "industry: AI consulting / agent orchestration / technology services. target_audience_primary: CTOs, VP Engineering, and engineering leads at mid-to-large enterprises and scaling startups who are evaluating or actively deploying AI agent systems in production — they are technical, skeptical of hype, and need production-grade answers not theoretical frameworks. target_audience_secondary: Startup founders and forward-thinking business leaders seeking practical AI-driven automation with measurable business outcomes. tone: Direct, technically credible, practitioner-first — written by engineers who ship real systems, not consultants who produce slide decks. No hype, no vague promises. Concrete stack references (Kubernetes, Kafka, Postgres), real failure modes, and honest trade-offs. messaging_pillars: (1) Production reality over proof-of-concept theater — we build systems that survive contact with real workloads. (2) Orchestration as a first-class engineering discipline, not an afterthought. (3) Stack-specific expertise — opinionated choices grounded in operational experience. (4) Measurable outcomes — agent systems justified by business impact, not novelty."}	content-gap-planner	content-gap-planner	\N	\N	f	2026-03-18 02:24:26.700818+00	2026-03-18 02:26:44.85706+00	content-gap-planner	f
