equiring bulk fuel purchases", "competitors_found": ["econogas.ca", "igasusa.com"], "has_existing_site": false, "existing_site_quality": "none", "unique_selling_points": ["Wholesale pricing for bulk fuel purchases", "Direct terminal access and distribution networks", "B2B focused fuel supply solutions", "Competitive rack pricing programs"], "target_market_and_locale": "Confirm whether Gas Wholesalers operates in the UK, US, or another market. If UK-based: replace 'gasoline' with 'petrol' or 'fuel' throughout, use UK business conventions (VAT, pence per litre pricing references), and ensure phone numbers and address formats are UK-standard. If US-based: replace the +44 phone number with a US number and audit all contact details. Once confirmed, update the service-areas page to explicitly name the regions, counties, or states served so prospects can immediately determine if they are in the coverage zone.", "target_audience_and_purpose": "Primary industry vertical: wholesale fuel distribution. Target audience segments: (1) forecourt operators and gas station owners purchasing bulk fuel for resale, (2) commercial fleet managers seeking reliable fuel supply contracts and rack pricing, (3) industrial facilities and large commercial buyers requiring consistent volume delivery. Site purpose: lead generation — drive qualified inbound inquiries from buyers who need a dependable wholesale fuel partner. All content decisions should be evaluated against these guardrails: does it speak to one of these three segments, does it reinforce reliability and transparency, and does it move a prospect toward a contact or inquiry action.", "industry_audience_tone_purpose": "Industry: Wholesale fuel distribution and natural gas supply. Target Audience: Gas station owners, fuel retailers, commercial fleet operators, industrial facilities, convenience store chains, and bulk fuel buyers. Tone: Experienced industry insiders — direct, no-nonsense, transparent, and reliability-focused; avoid salesy or overly promotional language. Primary Conversion Purpose: Drive qualified bulk fuel buyers and fleet operators to request pricing or initiate a supply relationship via contact or rack pricing inquiry.", "tagline_and_product_terminology": "Replace the current tagline 'Wholesale Gas Supply Solutions' with one that reflects the full product scope, such as 'Wholesale Fuel, Natural Gas & Specialty Gas Distribution' or 'Complete Wholesale Fuel & Gas Supply.' Define three canonical product categories for use across all pages: (1) Wholesale Fuel Distribution — gasoline, diesel, and refined petroleum products; (2) Natural Gas Distribution — commercial and industrial natural gas supply; (3) Specialty Gases — any non-commodity gas products referenced on the services page. Enforce this terminology framework site-wide so homepage subheadlines, service descriptions, page titles, and meta descriptions all use the same category names without variation.", "industry, target_audience, tone, purpose": "industry: 'wholesale fuel distribution'; target_audience: 'fuel retailers, fleet operators, commercial and industrial buyers'; tone: 'direct and professional'; purpose: 'generate qualified inbound leads for bulk fuel supply contracts'"}	content-gap-planner	content-gap-planner	\N	\N	f	2026-03-15 00:10:53.85067+00	2026-03-15 05:47:28.182463+00	content-gap-planner	f
