22c6324e-e1b7-40bc-9159-17789f04802a	1368e337-dd1d-4799-bbb3-8221a1b79bcc	page_content_about	{"content": {"founded_year": "2025", "team_members": [{"bio": "30 years as a software developer. A startup founder. An innovator and always keen to share ideas.", "name": "Peter Grenfell", "title": "Chief Technology Officer"}], "company_values": "Finetune – Company Values 1. Adventurous with Technology  We explore new ideas and emerging technologies with curiosity and courage. If there’s a better way to solve a problem using modern tools or AI, we want to find it.  2. Relentless Pursuit of Better  We are never satisfied with “good enough.” We constantly look for improvements, efficiencies, and smarter ways to work.  3. Practical Innovation  Technology only matters if it actually helps people. We focus on implementing useful technology where it really counts — improving workflows, saving time, and unlocking new capabilities.  4. Looking for the Edge  We help companies gain a competitive advantage through AI, automation, and intelligent systems. Our goal is to help clients do things faster, smarter, and at scale.  5. Helpful and Collaborative  We share knowledge and work closely with clients. Our aim is to empower teams to use AI themselves, not just depend on us.  6. Automation First  If something can be automated well, it should be. We focus on removing repetitive work so people can focus on what actually matters.  7. Scalable Intelligence  We believe the future of software is networks of intelligent agents working together. We build systems designed to scale — from single tools to thousands of cooperating AI agents.  8. Open Knowledge and Sharing  We believe in sharing knowledge, techniques, and ideas to help people adopt AI responsibly and effectively.  Finetune Mission   To help companies use AI and automation to work smarter, move faster, and build systems that scale.  Finetune Vision  A world where businesses use intelligent agents and automation as everyday infrastructure, removing friction from work and unlocking new creativity and productivity.", "company_description": "Finetune is adventurous with technology and pragmatic with outcomes. We are always looking for the edge — better tools, better systems, and better ways to turn emerging AI capabilities into something genuinely useful.    We design and deploy automation, intelligent agents, and custom AI models that remove repetitive work, surface useful information, and unlock entirely new workflows. We can train specialised models for you and build \\"RAG\\" systems to help you dig out information from your company data. We can and do deploy large networks of cooperating agents. We focus on using AI where it actually matters.  Our work ranges from large-scale, production automation pipelines and intelligent request routing, to bulk data collection, private AI deployments, and rapid website generation. We help companies experiment, prototype quickly, and move AI systems into real production environments.  Finetune builds practical AI systems for companies that want more than talk and hype.  If you're trying to make AI profitable, scalable, and practical inside your company, that's where we come in."}, "page_id": "c0c68034-469f-420c-90bd-d3c0fc0e13d2", "page_name": "about", "provided_by": "admin"}	admin-api	\N	\N	\N	t	2026-03-17 13:10:52.766503+00	\N	admin	f
