Starter / Professional / Enterprise) with a plain-language summary of which architectural patterns apply and what infrastructure they should be planning for. Serves as a soft qualification tool and naturally leads to the contact page.", "target_page": "services", "library_source": null, "tool_component_id": null}, {"name": "Kafka Throughput & Partition Estimator", "function": "tool-kafka-partition-estimator", "priority": 3, "complexity": "simple", "description": "A technical calculator for engineering teams planning Kafka-backed agent pipelines. Inputs include messages per second, average message size, retention period, replication factor, and number of consumer groups. Outputs recommended partition count, estimated disk usage, and throughput headroom. Highly credible for the technical audience, reinforces the company's Kafka expertise, and is directly useful to engineers evaluating whether their infrastructure can support a multi-agent system. Pairs naturally with the Kafka/Postgres blog post.", "target_page": "blog/building-a-hierarchical-agent-system-with-kafka-and-postgres", "library_source": null, "tool_component_id": null}, {"name": "AI Adoption Readiness Assessment", "function": "tool-ai-readiness-assessment", "priority": 4, "complexity": "moderate", "description": "A 10-question self-assessment covering data infrastructure maturity, team AI literacy, existing automation tooling, governance and compliance posture, and executive sponsorship. Produces a readiness score with a breakdown by category and practical next steps mapped to the company's services. Targets the secondary audience of startup founders and business leaders who are earlier in their AI journey and need orientation before engaging with a consultant.", "target_page": "services", "library_source": null, "tool_component_id": null}, {"name": "LLM Provider Cost Comparison Calculator", "function": "tool-llm-cost-calculator", "priority": 5, "complexity": "simple", "description": "Allows engineers to input their expected token volumes (input and output tokens per day), select from major LLM providers and models (GPT-4o, Claude 3.5, Gemini, Llama via hosted inference), and see a side-by-side monthly cost comparison. Supports the LLM provider abstraction blog post and reinforces the value of provider-agnostic architecture. Directly useful to engineering leads who are budgeting for production agent deployments.", "target_page": "blog/llm-provider-abstraction-production-agent-systems", "library_source": null, "tool_component_id": null}], "rejected_tools": [{"reason": "Targets marketers and ecommerce analysts, not engineering leads or CTOs evaluating agent infrastructure.", "function": "tool-ab-test-calculator"}, {"reason": "Midjourney-style image prompt builder is consumer/creative focused and irrelevant to production AI agent systems.", "function": "tool-prompt-architect"}, {"reason": "Built specifically for a gamified daily challenge product, has no relevance to enterprise AI consulting.", "function": "tool-archetype-taster-quiz"}, {"reason": "Useful for product or review platforms, not relevant to AI agent orchestration services.", "function": "tool-bayesian-ranking"}, {"reason": "Property finance tool, completely outside this industry.", "function": "tool-bridging-loan-calculator"}, {"reason": "Buy-to-let property investment calculator, irrelevant to AI consulting.", "function": "tool-btl-investor"}, {"reason": "Consumer property finance tool, no relevance to this audience.", "function": "tool-equity-release"}, {"reason": "Fleet fuel management tool, irrelevant to AI agent orchestration.", "function": "tool-fuel-cost-estimator"}, {"reason": "Energy sector utility, no connection to AI or software infrastructure.", "function": "tool-gas-unit-converter"}, {"reason": "Industrial robotics hardware tool, not relevant to software-based AI agent systems.", "function": "tool-gripper-payload-calculator"}, {"reason": "Game design tool for loot drop mechanics, irrelevant to 